Description: FlickOS developer kit: C and C++ builds: CMake, Meson, Ninja, Clang, Valgrind
 Build systems and a second compiler for C and C++ projects: CMake,
 Meson, Ninja, Clang, the Valgrind memory checker and pkgconf. The GNU
 compiler and make come with flickos-kit-base.
 .
 A kit is installed from Software's Developer Tools and removed there too.
 Nothing it installs runs until it is used (docs/design/flickos-dev.md).
